# PM Review Policy v3.0 (Closed Beta)

## Autonomous — no PM gate

```text
Develop → QA → Build → Lighthouse → Commit → Push → Production → Tag → Report
```

**Never ask PM:** deploy?, commit?, proceed?, Preview approval?

## PM approval before Production (only)

DB Schema · Billing · LLM/Real AI · Auth structure · Product Pivot · cost APIs

## PM reviews Production only (~5 min, 08:00 KST)

5-second Landing · 3-min Goal→GO · WOW = "AI PM colleague"

## Reports

Use `LaunchLens Daily Report` format. **No Preview URL.**

Full policy: `docs/PM_REVIEW_POLICY.md`
